config SENSOR_PROCESSING_ENABLE
    bool "M2 sensor management and sample processing"
    default n
    help
        Builds sensor payload processing and the GNSS log parser.
        The Flight application selects this option and adds device acquisition.

config SENSOR_INTEGRITY_ENABLE
    bool "Sensor Integrity Manager (source isolation and probation)"
    default n
    help
        Builds the source health state machine, sensor use policy and recovery
        probation described in spec 05. It consumes evidence such as rejected
        samples, device faults and timeouts.
